{"type":"text","timestamp":1778975781297,"sessionID":"ses_1cccbf924ffe5V1YAyCWKz7RJg","part":{"id":"prt_e33381c85001WzNoX7CCs17JvV","messageID":"msg_e3338178c001GsiZqZ4xaCKGks","sessionID":"ses_1cccbf924ffe5V1YAyCWKz7RJg","type":"text","text":"Implemented and committed the issue #9930 ontology update.\n\nCommit: `e3887a6 Add synonyms for GRIN-related disorder`\n\nChanges:\n- Added synonyms to `MONDO:1060138`:\n  - `GRINopathies` cited to `PMID:38795169`\n  - `GRIN-related encephalopathy` cited to `PMID:33043365`\n  - `GRIN-related neurodevelopmental disorder` cited to `PMID:38727899`\n- Added tracker link for issue `#9930`.\n- Did not add `GRIN-related complex neurodevelopmental disorder` as a synonym because it is already the term label.\n\nValidation:\n- Verified publication identifiers via PubMed records/E-utilities.\n- Used `obo-checkout.pl` and `obo-checkin.pl`.\n- Ran `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o mondo-edit.TMP.obo` successfully.\n- Attempted required ODK normalization, but `docker` is unavailable in this environment (`docker: command not found`).\n\nCreated uncommitted feedback files:\n- `ISSUE_COMMENTS.md`\n- `PR_COMMENTS.md`\n\nNote: the worktree still contains unrelated pre-existing untracked/deleted files, but the commit includes only `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`.","time":{"start":1778975775877,"end":1778975781294}}}
